Automated Smoke Test (Login & Main Page)
TC-SMK-01: Valid Login Authentication
Test Scenario: Verify that a registered, approved user can successfully log in and authenticate.
Pre-conditions: Test account is registered, approved, and active.
Steps to Execute:
Navigate to the Login Page URL (/login).
Enter valid credentials (username/email and password).
Click the "Login" button.
Expected Result:
The user is successfully authenticated (session cookie/JWT token stored).
System redirects the user to the Main Dashboard page (/dashboard or /home).
Server responds with HTTP 200 / 302 redirect.

TC-SMK-02: Main Page Layout & Core Navigation Verification
Test Scenario: Verify that key UI components and navigation elements on the Main Page render correctly upon login.
Steps to Execute:
Log in with an active user account.
Wait for the Main Page to fully load.
Verify the presence of essential UI elements:
Navigation bar / Header (Logo, User Profile menu, Logout option).
Sidebar navigation links.
Main dashboard widgets / summary panels.
Expected Result:
All primary page components load within acceptable threshold (< 3 seconds).
No UI rendering errors, broken visual assets, or console JavaScript errors appear.

TC-SMK-03: Invalid Credentials Login Block
Test Scenario: Verify that the system blocks login attempts with incorrect credentials.
Steps to Execute:
Navigate to the Login Page (/login).
Enter an active username with an incorrect password.
Click the "Login" button.
Expected Result:
Access is denied; user remains on the login page.
An error message is displayed (e.g., "Invalid username or password").
Server responds with HTTP 401 Unauthorized.

TC-SMK-04: Session Logout Verification
Test Scenario: Verify that logging out destroys the session and redirects to the login screen.
Steps to Execute:
From the Main Page, click the user profile menu.
Click the "Logout" button.
Attempt to navigate back to the Main Page (/dashboard) using the browser back button or direct URL access.
Expected Result:
User is redirected to the Login Page (/login).
Session token/cookie is invalidated.
